// Benchmark button and result messages
{0}{Benchmark}
{1}{Benchmark complete. Measurements saved. Reload the save before resuming play or running another test.}
{2}{Cannot start benchmark: load a save with a conscious character outside combat.}
{3}{No accessible route. Move to an open area, then click Benchmark again.}
{4}{Cannot create the benchmark measurement files.}
{5}{Benchmark stopped: the character did not reach a destination before the timeout.}
{6}{Benchmark stopped: a scenario action failed.}
{7}{Benchmark interrupted (Escape, focus loss, menu, map change or combat). Measurements are incomplete.}
{8}{Benchmark interrupted: the game lost focus. Keep it in the foreground until the completion message.}
{9}{Benchmark interrupted by a request to quit the game.}
{10}{Benchmark cancelled with Escape. Measurements are incomplete.}
